            "body": "We were tired of waking up tired, and tired of sleep \"solutions\" that never touched the real cause. So we built the simplest possible fix: a soft, breathable strip that keeps your lips sealed so your nose takes over. It's for everyone who snores, and the partners who put up with it. One strip a night. That's the whole routine.",
